menu "SmartCoaster"
    config SMARTCOASTER_WEIGHT_MOCK
        bool "Use the scripted weight sensor mock instead of HX711"
        default n
        help
            Replaces hx711_hw.c with hx711_mock.c. The mock replays a fixed
            weight script (cup / sip / refill / foreign object) and is used for
            QEMU smoke tests and demos. Never enable for a flashed board.
    config SMARTCOASTER_BATTERY_STUB
        bool "Stub the battery ADC path (QEMU has no SAR ADC model)"
        default n
        help
            QEMU 9.2 does not implement the ESP32-S3 SAR ADC. IDF's ADC
            self-calibration constructor then spins forever before app_main.
            This option replaces battery.c with a fixed 3.9 V stub so the rest
            of the firmware can be smoke-tested under QEMU. Never enable on
            hardware.
endmenu
